your blood pumping, especially when your opponent takes all the gems you sent over and sends them right back at you!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/d2cce86ec82592b63a6f45e6ff4fd5d1.avif?t=1751597992\" width=616 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/41d4894d32b9e4f4008553be221063e7.avif?t=1751597992\" width=616 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you new to VTumbler and Puzzle Fighter games? We've got a relatively easy training mode set up just for you! This lets you experience the full extent of gameplay VTumbler has to offer, including seeing all the cute animations from your favorite VTuber. The Training CPU only does basic strategizing, but it knows how to randomly crack a jackpot and put you under pressure if you're not careful. Use training mode to get a feeling for the game and hop into online play afterwards to show everyone what you got!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/194df08fb1e0dc4179b8d92e6688b05e.webp?t=1751597992\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/9d24aef3fe958763e935f84d9f55947c.poster.avif?t=1751597992\" width=616 height=399 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/9d24aef3fe958763e935f84d9f55947c.webm?t=1751597992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/d116eaa44fe1be3a1e653d3e26b1339b.poster.avif?t=1751597992\" width=616 height=399 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/d116eaa44fe1be3a1e653d3e26b1339b.webm?t=1751597992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/b52c1ff9a500c9afdeb119ce72fa37c7.avif?t=1751597992\" width=616 height=495 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/91361e13e26880ab3f0ed38368e469fd.avif?t=1751597992\" width=616 height=399 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/9547c7abe943637d5dc791540580338c.avif?t=1751597992\" width=616 height=495 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744110/extras/96e4a5265c0c5e9345f2273115964e83.webp?t=1751597992\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Online Versus Friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Online Versus Randoms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Select</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Character Animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage Select</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-Combat Gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.